      "created": 1793000255336,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Inspect the Metrics of the vLLM Model Serving Runtime ( Generative Model )\n \n° For example, get :\n    - the Time to First Token (TTFT ) Metric \n    - the total number of input tokens processed across all requests ( vllm:prompt_tokens_total Metric )\n    - the total number of output tokens generated by the model ( vllm:generation_tokens_total Metric )",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Inspect the Metrics of the vLLM Model Serving Runtime ( Generative Model )\n \n° For example, get :\n    - the Time to First Token (TTFT ) Metric \n    - the total number of input tokens processed across all requests ( vllm:prompt_tokens_total Metric )\n    - the total number of output tokens generated by the model ( vllm:generation_tokens_total Metric )",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
