      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[student@workstation monitoring-performance]$ oc get ServingRuntime/qwen3-06b -o yaml\napiVersion: serving.kserve.io/v1alpha1\nkind: ServingRuntime\nmetadata:\n  annotations:\n     ...\n  labels:\n    opendatahub.io/dashboard: \"true\"\n  name: qwen3-06b\n  namespace: monitoring-performance\n\nspec:\n  annotations:\n    opendatahub.io/kserve-runtime: vllm\n\n    prometheus.io/path: /metrics\n    prometheus.io/port: \"8080\"\n\n  containers:\n  - args:\n    - --port=8080\n    - --model=/mnt/models\n    - --served-model-name={{.Name}}\n    - --disable-log-requests\n    - --max-model-len=8192\n    command:\n    - python\n    - -m\n    - vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server\n    env:\n    - name: HF_HOME\n      value: /data/huggingface\n    - name: VLLM_CACHE_ROOT\n      value: /data/vllm\n    - name: VLLM_CPU_KVCACHE_SPACE\n      value: \"6\"\n    image: registry.lab.example.com:8443/redhattraining/vllm/custom-chat-vllm-cpu:v0.14.0\n    name: kserve-container\n    ports:\n    - containerPort: 8080\n      protocol: TCP\n    volumeMounts:\n    - mountPath: /data\n      name: models-cache\n    - mountPath: /dev/shm\n      name: shm\n  multiModel: false\n  supportedModelFormats:\n  - autoSelect: true\n    name: vLLM\n  volumes:\n  - name: models-cache\n    persistentVolumeClaim:\n      claimName: vllm-models\n  - emptyDir:\n      medium: Memory\n      sizeLimit: 4Gi\n    name: shm\n\n\n\n[student@workstation monitoring-performance]$ oc get InferenceService/qwen3-06b -o yaml\napiVersion: serving.kserve.io/v1beta1\nkind: InferenceService\nmetadata:\n  annotations:\n     ...\n\n  labels:\n    ...\n  name: qwen3-06b\n  namespace: monitoring-performance\n\nspec:\n  predictor:\n    automountServiceAccountToken: false\n    maxReplicas: 1\n    minReplicas: 1\n    model:\n      modelFormat:\n        name: vLLM\n      name: \"\"\n      resources:\n        limits:\n          cpu: \"10\"\n          memory: 16Gi\n        requests:\n          cpu: \"4\"\n          memory: 12Gi\n      runtime: qwen3-06b\n      storageUri: oci://registry.lab.example.com:8443/redhattraining/oci-models/qwen3_0.6b:latest\n    timeout: 300\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793000457868,
