      "text": "PROMPTS=(\n    \"What is Kubernetes?\"\n    \"Explain containers in one sentence.\"\n    \"What is OpenShift?\"\n    \"Define machine learning briefly.\"\n    \"What is model serving?\"\n    \"Explain inference in AI.\"\n    \"What is a neural network?\"\n    \"Define MLOps in one sentence.\"\n    \"What is a GPU?\"\n    \"Explain Prometheus monitoring.\"\n)",
