      "text": "[student@workstation ~]$ oc get svc\nNAME                   TYPE        CLUSTER-IP       EXTERNAL-IP   PORT(S)    AGE\ndistilbert-metrics     ClusterIP   172.30.35.14     <none>        8888/TCP   21m\ndistilbert-predictor   ClusterIP   None             <none>        80/TCP     21m\nqwen3-06b-metrics      ClusterIP   172.30.218.170   <none>        8080/TCP   21m\nqwen3-06b-predictor    ClusterIP   None             <none>        80/TCP     21m\n\n\n\n[student@workstation ~]$ oc get svc/distilbert-metrics -o yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  ...\n  labels:\n    monitoring.opendatahub.io/scrape: \"true\"\n    name: distilbert-metrics\n  name: distilbert-metrics\n  namespace: monitoring-performance\n\nspec:\n  clusterIP: 172.30.35.14\n  clusterIPs:\n  - 172.30.35.14\n  internalTrafficPolicy: Cluster\n  ipFamilies:\n  - IPv4\n  ipFamilyPolicy: SingleStack\n  ports:\n  - name: kserve-ovms-metrics\n    port: 8888\n    protocol: TCP\n    targetPort: 8888\n  selector:\n    serving.kserve.io/inferenceservice: distilbert\n  sessionAffinity: None\n  type: ClusterIP\n\n\n\n\n[student@workstation ~]$ oc get svc/qwen3-06b-metrics -o yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  ...\n  labels:\n    monitoring.opendatahub.io/scrape: \"true\"\n    name: qwen3-06b-metrics\n  name: qwen3-06b-metrics\n  namespace: monitoring-performance\n\nspec:\n  clusterIP: 172.30.218.170\n  clusterIPs:\n  - 172.30.218.170\n  internalTrafficPolicy: Cluster\n  ipFamilies:\n  - IPv4\n  ipFamilyPolicy: SingleStack\n  ports:\n  - name: qwen3-06b-metrics\n    port: 8080\n    protocol: TCP\n    targetPort: 8080\n  selector:\n    serving.kserve.io/inferenceservice: qwen3-06b\n  sessionAffinity: None\n  type: ClusterIP\n\n",
