      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793000892790,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "rate(v range-vector) calculates the per-second average rate\nof increase of the time series in the range vector.\n\n\nThe following example expression returns the per-second average\nrate of HTTP requests over the last 5 minutes, per time series in the range vector:\n    \n        rate(http_requests_total{job=\"api-server\"}[5m])",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "rate(v range-vector) calculates the per-second average rate\nof increase of the time series in the range vector.\n\n\nThe following example expression returns the per-second average\nrate of HTTP requests over the last 5 minutes, per time series in the range vector:\n    \n        rate(http_requests_total{job=\"api-server\"}[5m])",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793000887124,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
